RESULTSdIn the combined studies, odds ratios in those with transferrin saturation \$50\% vs. ,50\% were 2.1 (95\% CI 1.3–3.4; P = 0.003) for any form of diabetes; 2.6 (1.2–5.6; P = 0.01) for type 1 diabetes; and 1.7 (1.4–2.1; P = 0.001) for type 2 diabetes.
