	title = {Progression from impaired fasting glucose to type 2 diabetes mellitus among {Chinese} subjects with and without hypertension in a primary care setting 在中国初级保健机构中合并以及不合并高血压的受试者从空腹血糖受损进展到2型糖尿病的调查},
